        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 178AST Solid Brass Angel Strike Plate for Surface Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Angle Strike for Surface Bolts comes packaged with matching finish mounting screws. It can be used with any manufactures surface door bolt that has a 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-178AST-specification.gif?v=1704354640\" width=\"419\" height=\"216\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 178AST Angle Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis strike plate fits <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-6sb\"><b>Deltana 6SB 6\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-8-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-8sb\"><b>Deltana 8SB 8\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-12-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-12sb\"><b>Deltana 12SB 12\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-18-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-18sb\"><b>Deltana 18SB 18\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-24-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-24sb\"><b>Deltana 24SB 24\" Surface Bolt</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 178AST Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip Length: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
